Order Service Responsibilities
================================
Order-service should handle:
✔ 1. Place Order
Reads cart items
Creates order record
✔ 2. Validate User
Calls user-service
✔ 3. Validate Product + Stock
Calls product-service
✔ 4. Calculate Total Price
From cart-service OR product-service
✔ 5. Publish Event (optional later)
Kafka / RabbitMQ (future enhancement)